<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="幽影林">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The Shadowwood Forest is the setting of Aili's adventure, a place of mystery and trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The ancient forest of 'Yao Ying Lin' shrouded in mist, known for a hidden secret that only the pure of heart and brave can uncover.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="艾莉">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">A lively and brave young girl named Aili, the daughter of a famous explorer, who decides to uncover the secret of Yao Ying Lin.&lt;SEP&gt;Aili is the protagonist who embarks on a real adventure journey and encounters challenges.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="艾莉的父亲">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">Aili's father, a famous explorer, who had attempted to enter Yao Ying Lin but never returned with success.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="幽影林的秘密">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">The hidden secret of Yao Ying Lin, which is a legend to be uncovered by those with purity and courage.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="迷雾">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The fog is a mysterious phenomenon that shrouds the ancient kingdom and is cleared by Aili, revealing the kingdom.&lt;SEP&gt;The mist that envelops Yao Ying Lin, making the forest mysterious and challenging for adventurers.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="小镇">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A small town on the edge of Yao Ying Lin where Aili lives.&lt;SEP&gt;The town is where Aili returns with the crystal, becoming a hero celebrated by the townspeople.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="石碑">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">An ancient stone tablet with mysterious symbols, indicating the presence of an ancient civilization or secret.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="水晶球">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">A mystical crystal ball with a faint figure, possibly a guardian or entity from the forest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="古老遗迹">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">Ancient ruins beneath Yao Ying Lin, discovered by Aili, filled with ancient books and magical artifacts.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="被诅咒的湖">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A cursed lake in Yao Ying Lin with a crystal said to dispel the mist and reveal the secret of the forest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="考验">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Three trials Aili must pass to prove her courage, wisdom, and kindness in order to find the crystal.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="森林">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The dense forest itself, where Yao Ying Lin is located, full of mist and mystery.&lt;SEP&gt;The forest is a location where Aili begins her adventure and continues to walk through during her journey.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="探险者">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">Explorers who have ventured into Yao Ying Lin but have not returned, adding to the legend of the forest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="小兔子">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">A small, curious rabbit that Aili encounters in the forest, possibly aiding her in her quest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="石阶">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The steps leading down to the mysterious underground chamber where the ancient books and artifacts are kept.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="画像">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The strange paintings found in the ancient ruins, depicting various mythical creatures.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="守护者">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">The guardian is a character who reveals the beginning of an adventure and vanishes into the crystal ball.&lt;SEP&gt;The guardian of the forest, an elderly figure who reveals the trials to Aili and her purpose in the forest.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="水晶">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The crystal is a magical object given to Aili by the bird, representing her success in all trials.&lt;SEP&gt;The crystal mentioned by the guardian, which is said to be the key to dispelling the mist and revealing the secret.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="山谷">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A valley with a rapid river that Aili must cross, possibly representing one of the trials she must overcome.&lt;SEP&gt;The valley is a geographical feature Aili arrives at, where she encounters a dangerous bridge over a river.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="石桥">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The dangerous bridge over the river that Aili must cross, a literal obstacle she must overcome on her journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The stone bridge is a crossing over the river in the valley that Aili must cross, which is filled with thorns.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="荆棘">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The thorns on the bridge are a physical obstacle Aili must navigate, representing a challenge.&lt;SEP&gt;The thorny bridge on the river that Aili must navigate, symbolizing her challenges on the path to the secret.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5f42891803957bc7f3adf5e701914e6</data>
</node>
<node id="蜘蛛">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">The spider is a creature Aili encounters on the bridge, representing a challenge she must overcome.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="短剑">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The short sword is an object Aili uses to fight and defeat the spider, symbolizing her courage.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="花园">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The garden is a mysterious location Aili reaches after passing the bridge, filled with unique flowers and a riddle.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="谜题">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
