<node id="Karush-Kuhn-Tucker (KKT) 条件">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Karush-Kuhn-Tucker (KKT) conditions are a set of necessary conditions for a solution to be optimal in a constrained optimization problem.&lt;SEP&gt;This term refers to a set of conditions used in optimization theory, known as KKT conditions, which are discussed in the document.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-476294527e1c59400f3b0cb2686b7ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9984e6dcc963f6f96cb0144ae4d318</data>
