</node>
<node id="梯度下降法">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Gradient descent is an optimization algorithm that uses the negative gradient of a function as a guide for finding the local minimum of a function. It is commonly used in machine learning to train models.&lt;SEP&gt;Gradient descent is an optimization algorithm used to find the minimum of a function.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a technique used to minimize communication cost, which involves compressing gradients and performing local training rounds.&lt;SEP&gt;This term refers to a specific optimization algorithm known as gradient descent, which is discussed in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;文中提到的梯度下降法，是一种优化算法。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1daed866d8750642dcecc03dc8933344&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9984e6dcc963f6f96cb0144ae4d318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c24198222afa92c497fa476e00ef81db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81cb9bc58fbb6b43753e03e568548331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b9cad1a482c29a56b35fc8a645c21c</data>
</node>
<node id="牛顿法">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">An optimization method that uses second-order information to find the minimum of a function.&lt;SEP&gt;Newton's method is an optimization algorithm that uses second-order derivatives to find the minimum of a function.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a method used for local multi-round updates to reduce communication between clients and servers.&lt;SEP&gt;This term refers to a specific optimization algorithm known as Newton's method, which is discussed in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;文中提到的牛顿法，是一种迭代算法，用于求解非线性优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1daed866d8750642dcecc03dc8933344&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9984e6dcc963f6f96cb0144ae4d318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81cb9bc58fbb6b43753e03e568548331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-261e2b461646c649ae18e976ba31858f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5b9cad1a482c29a56b35fc8a645c21c</data>
</node>
<node id="次梯度法">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">This term refers to a specific optimization algorithm known as subgradient method, which is discussed in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;次梯度法是一种优化算法，具有扩展性强、简单易用等特点，但收敛速度慢，调参困难。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0107a3ccd7e97426751cad3f41a24c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9984e6dcc963f6f96cb0144ae4d318</data>
</node>
<node id="Shrinkage Operator">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">A method used in federated learning to dynamically sparse the model parameters, reducing storage and communication costs.&lt;SEP&gt;Represents the operation used to dynamically adjust model parameters based on device capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage Operator is a key tool for solving l1 regularization optimization problems in federated learning, capable of handling high-dimensional sparse data.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage Operator is a mathematical operation that is used in optimization to project a vector onto a set of vectors, and is applied in the 𝓵1 regularization in federated learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage Operator is a mathematical tool that promotes sparsity in optimization problems, particularly in signal processing and regularization tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage Operator是用于求解正则化问题的工具，在稀疏信号处理、统计学习和图像处理等领域有广泛应用。&lt;SEP&gt;Shrinkage operator is a function that shrinks the parameter values towards a reference value, typically zero, to achieve sparsity.&lt;SEP&gt;This technique involves transmitting sparse model parameters to reduce communication cost and maintain model performance.&lt;SEP&gt;This term refers to a mathematical operator used in optimization, which is discussed in the document.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ead56231c879e9b3817d4e56ec1f8515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9984e6dcc963f6f96cb0144ae4d318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bff4b6b0014283ad3c5e684ce7a25986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81cb9bc58fbb6b43753e03e568548331&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c5c912f6b46d4dd53664780b33bb589&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53e7e73846d2eaaea200c6f3139c38fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0107a3ccd7e97426751cad3f41a24c91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b70a45587e0757d21f98b0f35e3f0ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f00f00a3a5eeee63105409d939e3f519</data>
</node>
