<node id="子空间 𝑉 &lt; ">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Subspace 𝑉 &lt; is the orthogonal complement of the subspace 𝑉, containing all vectors that are orthogonal to every vector in 𝑉.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0bce880b9d8eb573945d1e3eb7bec38</data>
