</node>
<node id="Adam">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Adam is an optimization algorithm that combines the advantages of both SGD and momentum, often used in training deep learning models.&lt;SEP&gt;Adam is an optimization method with adaptive learning rates.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-261e2b461646c649ae18e976ba31858f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fbd0f4fadeca6e3a55b410c4f12cf</data>
</node>
<node id="模型更新">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
