  <data key="d6">chunk-50f15e4e7e2e5d4a402eea2e94ad742c</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hessian" target="Newton's Method">
  <data key="d3">8.0</data>
  <data key="d4">Newton's Method utilizes the Hessian matrix of the objective function to accelerate convergence, especially in problems with a large condition number, outperforming Gradient Descent.</data>
