<edge source="计算近端算子" target="Jacobi 和 Gauss-Seidel 方法">
  <data key="d3">8.0</data>
  <data key="d4">The calculation of the proximity operator is related to iterative methods like Jacobi and Gauss-Seidel, which are used to solve problems that involve the proximity operator. These methods involve updating the solution iteratively until a certain convergence criterion is met."|&gt;"application, iterative method</data>
  <data key="d5">8</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-47d799488921d39a7d144085504292d8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="计算近端算子" target="Lasso 问题">
  <data key="d3">9.0</data>
