</edge>
<edge source=" prox⋅(b) " target="arg min ">
  <data key="d3">7.0</data>
  <data key="d4">The proximity operator prox⋅(b) is used to find the minimum of a function, which is a fundamental concept in optimization problems."|&gt;"application, optimization</data>
  <data key="d5">7</data>
